<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- G11a-1 fixture, written by hand for the tests of PPP (no source music): the three pedals of a piano, in 4/4, one bar = 4 quarters, a right-hand and a left-hand line.
     Damper (printed): down at 0, CHANGED at 2 (it lifts and presses again), up at the end of bar 2 (8).
     Soft pedal (sound only): down at 8, up at 12. Sostenuto (sound only): down at 10, up at 14.
     Half damper (sound only, depth 64): down at 16, up at 20. (The printed pedal is closed before a sound-only one opens: the importer closes the last one open.) -->
